<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 3 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Oct 3 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.0315 trillion in the week to October 3 from $1.1235 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     58.29		61.22</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     29.81		27.77</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  973.23	   1,062.32</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    209.57	     164.75</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	713.92	     803.25</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    317.60	     320.29</p>
</text>
